### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List All Leave Requests (Admin/Manager)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/leave-requests
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List My Leave Requests
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/leave-requests/my-requests
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Leave Request by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/leave-requests/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Submit New Leave Request
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/leave-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "leaveTypeId": 1,
    "startDate": "2026-04-01",
    "endDate": "2026-04-05",
    "reason": "Family gathering"
}

###

### Approve/Reject Leave Request
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/leave-requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "comment": "Approved by HR"
}
